<Layout title="Website & Recruitment Disclaimer" description="Read the website disclaimer for Ankit Jobs & Staffing India, including representative imagery, opportunity availability and the current registration status." noindex>
  <PageHero title="Information You Can Put in Context." eyebrow="Website disclaimer" text="Draft disclaimer for client and legal approval before public launch."/>
  <section class="section"><article class="container legal-content"><div class="draft-banner"><strong>Draft — approval required before launch.</strong><p>Service descriptions, the proposed process and legal content must be confirmed by the business.</p></div><h2>No employment guarantee</h2><p>A website visit, enquiry or registration does not guarantee employment, an interview or a particular outcome. Opportunities depend on genuine vacancy availability, role requirements and employer selection.</p><h2>Services and process</h2><p>Service descriptions introduce the recruitment areas in the supplied design brief. Their operational scope requires business confirmation. The How It Works sequence is a proposed outline, not a confirmed policy or a promise of a particular recruitment outcome.</p><h2>Current vacancies</h2><p>No verified live vacancy details have been supplied. The website does not publish invented jobs, hiring companies, salaries or application deadlines.</p><h2>Representative imagery</h2><p>Workforce and recruitment photographs are AI-generated illustrations of professional situations. They do not depict actual staff, clients, successful candidates or confirmed vacancies. The company logo is the original supplied artwork, optimized for web display.</p><h2>Registration status</h2><p>The candidate form currently validates details within your browser only. It does not send or save completed registration data. A secure processing endpoint and approved privacy terms are required before collection is enabled.</p><h2>Confirm the details</h2><p>Speak with <a href="/contact-us/">the team</a> to confirm current service availability, fees, vacancy information and applicable terms.</p></article></section>
</Layout>
